WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Your Kivo address is at the top of the AI Assistants page.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.700
Copy it once. The setup below already knows it is copied.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:11.800
Choose Claude (or ChatGPT): three steps, with the exact clicks shown.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.800
In your assistant: add a custom connector and paste the address. (Clip still to be recorded.)

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.700
Kivo shows what the assistant may do. Nothing connects until you press Allow.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:28.700
What your assistant saves lands in Kivo: here, a note it wrote, on the Knowledge Map.
